{
  "dom_id": "step-649412",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Recognizing Series That Are Similar to the Maclaurin Expansion for Sine",
  "problem": "What is the sum of the series $\\dfrac{\\pi}{3} - \\dfrac{(\\pi/3)^3}{3!} + \\dfrac{(\\pi/3)^5}{5!}-\\cdots + \\dfrac{(-1)^{n}(\\pi/3)^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!}+\\cdots\\,?$",
  "worked_solution": "We recognize that the series looks similar to the Maclaurin expansion for $f(x) = \\sin x.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =x-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3!}+\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5!}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}{x}^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!}+⋯\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$ into our Maclaurin expansion gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}-\\frac{(\\pi /3)^{3}}{3!}+\\frac{(\\pi /3)^{5}}{5!}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}(\\pi /3)^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!}+⋯ \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}-\\frac{(\\pi /3)^{3}}{3!}+\\frac{(\\pi /3)^{5}}{5!}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}(\\pi /3)^{2n+1}}{(2n+1)!}+⋯\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sum of the series is $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-649412\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"649412\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"759\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-649412\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Recognizing Series That Are Similar to the Maclaurin Expansion for Sine</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"649412\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            marg